EnabledCardActionsForObject=Actions to generate on the object card
EnabledCardActionsForObjectHelp=Only the selected action buttons are generated on the card page. Unselecting an action removes its button and its confirmation dialog, not the capability itself: the shared core action handler still processes the request if a user forges the URL and holds the permission.
